    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced today the completion of its previously announced acquisition of Entellus Medical. Entellus is a high-growth global medical technology company focused on delivering superior patient and physician experiences through products designed for the minimally invasive treatment of various ear, nose and throat (ENT) disease states.</p>\n<p>See full release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-completes-acquisition-of-Entellus-Medical/default.aspx\">here</a>.</p>\n",
